      "side": 1,
      "message": "To make the \"Release-Notes\" submit requirement pass you need to add a \"Release-Notes\" footer. The value of this footer is added to the release notes later when a new Gerrit version is released. So something like \"Release-Notes: Add config to control if review footers should be included into the commit message on submit\" should work (must be a single line).",
